# Code of Conduct

AOTA Marketplace strives to be a friendly, inclusive community.

## ✨ Expectations
- Be respectful
- Welcome new contributors
- Help others
- Assume good intentions

## 🚫 Unacceptable Behavior
- Harassment or discrimination
- Personal attacks
- Trolling or spamming

## 🆘 Reporting Issues
If you have concerns, contact the repository owner through GitHub.